          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The unflavored NOW Sports powders are about as clean as protein powder gets: whey isolate with under 1 percent sunflower lecithin, pea or soy protein isolate alone, or egg white with added BCAAs. None has a sweetener, gum or flavoring. We found no published heavy metal results for these products, which is the one gap in an otherwise simple label."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does NOW Sports whey isolate contain lactose or artificial sweeteners?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It contains no sweetener of any kind in the unflavored version, per the label. As a whey isolate it is low in lactose, with 1 g of total carbohydrate per scoop, but NOW does not label it lactose-free, so people with severe lactose intolerance should be cautious. The flavored versions add sweetener and flavoring; check their labels."
