          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            NOW Sports makes plain, cheap protein that does what it says. The Whey Protein Isolate is the one to buy: 24 g of protein in 110 calories, no sweetener, an Informed Sport registry listing and about $1.55 to $1.72 per 25 g. The Pea Protein is the budget vegan choice at about $1.02 per 25 g, as long as you can live with an earthy taste.
